  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="PT">BIOFIN&#x2019;s second phase enables up to 132 countries to complete the design and implementation of priority finance solutions and allowed a further 11 countries to undertake the assessments and create the finance plan. At the central level, knowledge management platforms will be expanded and additional guidance produced for most valuable finance solutions.</narrative>
